  "title": "Swedish Nuts",
  "description": "This recipe for sweet Swedish nuts uses pecans. Great for gifting at Christmas to any nut lovers in your life!",
  "authors": [
    "Joanie Critchlow"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
